<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>[FusionChart] 차트 타입을 스크립트로 변경하기 - Multi Series</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_7b4b594bc0a0d64b" class="chapter_title">[FusionChart] 차트 타입을 스크립트로 변경하기 - Multi Series</h1><h1 id="r_6a71581c830db2f5" class="element heading1" data-element-id="6a71581c830db2f5"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_af099649219f35a3" class="element pre" data-element-id="af099649219f35a3">Fusionchart의 'Multi Series' 타입을 확인할 수 있는 예제입니다.
차트의 타입은 'changeType' 메소드를 사용하여 설정할 수 있습니다.</pre><div id="r_6e7fa396c9a7649d" class="element note" data-element-id="6e7fa396c9a7649d"><p>이 예제의 Fusion Chart 버전은 3.19입니다.</p><p>FusionChart 가이드 : <a class="link" href="https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/fusioncharts">https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/fusioncharts</a></p><p>FusionChart의 타입 목록 : <a class="link" href="https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/chart-guide/list-of-charts/">https://www.fusioncharts.com/dev/chart-guide/list-of-charts/</a></p></div><p id="r_8719dd14a5cdbeb4" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="8719dd14a5cdbeb4"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00305">P00305</a></p><h1 id="r_92b6d7d4e573bc9b" class="element heading1" data-element-id="92b6d7d4e573bc9b"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_711ce281cbc63843" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="711ce281cbc63843"><li><p>스크립트로 'Multi Series' 타입 변경하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_ea65872fbb0a2696" class="element heading1" data-element-id="ea65872fbb0a2696"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_1cfeb3ed23137ec0" class="element heading2" data-element-id="1cfeb3ed23137ec0"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>스크립트로 'Multi Series' 타입 변경하기</span></div></h2><pre id="r_0a1010b66ba370d4" class="element pre" data-element-id="0a1010b66ba370d4">화면에 'Multi Series' 차트 타입이 Radio로 구성되어 있습니다. 항목을 선택(클릭)하면 차트 타입이 변경됩니다.</pre><div id="r_cc9d61d4b6352f9b" class="element step1" data-element-id="cc9d61d4b6352f9b"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>CASE 1. 'Multi-series Column 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_795b1c1df96307aa" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="795b1c1df96307aa"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Multi-series Column 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image437.png" width="351" height="378" /></p></div><div id="r_b12cfe5559f1d130" class="element step1" data-element-id="b12cfe5559f1d130"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>CASE 2. 'Multi-series Column 3D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_e205797104572847" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="e205797104572847"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Multi-series Column 3D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image438.png" width="351" height="379" /></p></div><div id="r_1ad971c9565f12eb" class="element step1" data-element-id="1ad971c9565f12eb"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>CASE 3. 'Multi-series Line 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_7f3cc7f500ccd92f" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="7f3cc7f500ccd92f"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 3.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Multi-series Line 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image439.png" width="351" height="378" /></p></div><div id="r_7a792089fdd7c8fd" class="element step1" data-element-id="7a792089fdd7c8fd"><p class="step1_n">4</p><p>CASE 4. 'Multi-series Bar 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_76286fc096b5fd40" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="76286fc096b5fd40"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 4.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Multi-series Bar 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image440.png" width="350" height="377" /></p></div><div id="r_27a83aade2612ce4" class="element step1" data-element-id="27a83aade2612ce4"><p class="step1_n">5</p><p>CASE 5. 'Multi-series Bar 3D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_a583844fed5fcad0" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="a583844fed5fcad0"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 5.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Multi-series Bar 3D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image441.png" width="351" height="376" /></p></div><div id="r_dc807967aba4b2f9" class="element step1" data-element-id="dc807967aba4b2f9"><p class="step1_n">6</p><p>CASE 6. 'Overlapped Column 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_410c357b0271837e" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="410c357b0271837e"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 6.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Overlapped Column 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image442.png" width="350" height="377" /></p></div><div id="r_6df47151a8d37b3f" class="element step1" data-element-id="6df47151a8d37b3f"><p class="step1_n">7</p><p>CASE 7. 'Overlapped Bar 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_f6670ee8a86630c1" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="f6670ee8a86630c1"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 7.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Overlapped Bar 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image443.png" width="351" height="379" /></p></div><div id="r_d381aae1089801a1" class="element step1" data-element-id="d381aae1089801a1"><p class="step1_n">8</p><p>CASE 8. 'Multi-series Area 2D' 타입</p></div><div id="r_fcd332b8a67e37be" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="fcd332b8a67e37be"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 8.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Multi-series Area 2D' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image444.png" width="350" height="376" /></p></div><div id="r_12733603de5b88ae" class="element step1" data-element-id="12733603de5b88ae"><p class="step1_n">9</p><p>CASE 9. 'Marimekko' 타입</p></div><div id="r_b448f743e4eac918" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="b448f743e4eac918"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 9.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Marimekko' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image445.png" width="350" height="379" /></p></div><div id="r_97bfa636e82ec19a" class="element step1" data-element-id="97bfa636e82ec19a"><p class="step1_n">10</p><p>CASE 10. 'Zoom Line' 타입</p></div><div id="r_7ae87e611a97a3ee" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="7ae87e611a97a3ee"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 10.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Zoom Line' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image446.png" width="351" height="379" /></p></div><div id="r_9bfcb2fe4ed978e3" class="element step1" data-element-id="9bfcb2fe4ed978e3"><p class="step1_n">11</p><p>CASE 11. 'Zoom Line DY' 타입</p></div><div id="r_ced3f6f3767cad53" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="ced3f6f3767cad53"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 11.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시 - 'Zoom Line DY' 타입</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image447.png" width="351" height="377" /></p></div><h1 id="r_073744794f978a08" class="element heading1" data-element-id="073744794f978a08"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_0807096f9fac5723" class="element heading2" data-element-id="0807096f9fac5723"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>스크립트로 'Multi Series' 타입 변경하기</span></div></h2><p id="r_0a3782cb1ece294f" class="element normal" data-element-id="0a3782cb1ece294f">FusionChart의 'changeType' 메소드를 사용하여 스크립트를 작성합니다.</p><div id="r_6264bf06751ba430" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="6264bf06751ba430"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// 'Multi Series' 타입 변경 예시</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Multi-series Column 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'mscolumn2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Multi-series Column 3D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'mscolumn3d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Multi-series Line 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'msline'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Multi-series Bar 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'msbar2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Multi-series Bar 3D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'msbar3d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Overlapped Column 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'overlappedcolumn2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Overlapped Bar 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'overlappedbar2d'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Multi-series Area 2D'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'msarea'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Marimekko'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'marimekko'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Zoom Line'으로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'zoomline'</span>);
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">// Fusionchart 'cht_exam1'의 차트 타입을 'Zoom Line DY'로 변경합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>cht_exam1.changeType(<span class="r_h_string_span">'zoomlinedy'</span>);</pre></div><div id="r_2c0f962d44010b91" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="2c0f962d44010b91"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 2.</span>Source</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;w2:fusionchart <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">chartType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"MSColumn2D"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">drawType</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"javascript"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">id</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"cht_exam1"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">labelNode</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"quarter"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">ref</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"data:dlt_chartData_1"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">seriesColumns</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"[['type1','type2','type3']]"</span> <span class="r_h_attribute_name_span">style</span>=<span class="r_h_attribute_value_span">"height: 300px;min-width:200px;"</span>&gt;
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>&lt;/w2:fusionchart&gt;</pre></div><div id="r_e7cdc4fa0b83778d" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="e7cdc4fa0b83778d"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 3.</span>DataList 'dlt_chartData_1'의 JSON 유형의 데이터</p><pre><span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>[
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"quarter"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"Q1"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"11500"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"28110"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"23990"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"quarter"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"Q2"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"1500"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"10600"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"10000"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"quarter"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"Q3"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"27400"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"31800"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"42800"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;},
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;{
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"quarter"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"Q4"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type1"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"27400"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type2"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"22900"</span>,
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="r_h_string_span">"type3"</span>: <span class="r_h_string_span">"20800"</span>
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;}
<span class="digits_10 code_line"></span>]</pre></div><h1 id="r_aadddb2cb605afae" class="element heading1" data-element-id="aadddb2cb605afae"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_fe8e4828ae6f84d3" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="fe8e4828ae6f84d3"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">chartType ( chartType )</span> </p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">setChartAttribute( options )</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">draw( )</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>